rule constraint_reach v1
description "A table whose last row only a constraint rules out: the check lets the row through, since E102 stops a rule only where a derived or define value takes part, and a question over ranges of the inputs leaves it out"

enum band = small | big | huge

inputs
  amount : money[GBP]  range >=1GBP <=100GBP
  limit  : money[GBP]  range >=0GBP <=100GBP

constraint limit <= amount

outputs
  out : band

table t
policy unique
| amount  | limit   | -> out : band |
| >50GBP  | -       | big           |
| <=50GBP | <=50GBP | small         |
| <=50GBP | >50GBP  | huge          |

examples
| amount | limit | -> out |
| 1GBP   | 0GBP  | small  |
| 100GBP | 0GBP  | big    |
